              "value": "Eclipse Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, darkness, occult)\n\n100 feet. Light and shadows morph strangely around the bul-gae. Non-magical bright light is reduced to 3 within the aura. When a creature attempts an action within the aura that has the light trait, it must attempt a DC 34 Will save. On a failure, the action is disrupted."
